msgstr "当此处发生变更时，向你自己的服务器发送签名消息。消息仅包含 ID 和变更字段名，绝不携带名称、位置或数值。"

msgid "A thing comes back from Trash"
msgstr "物品从回收站还原"

msgid "A thing goes to Trash"
msgstr "物品移入回收站"

msgid "A thing is added"
msgstr "添加物品时"

msgid "A thing is changed"
msgstr "物品有变更时"

msgid "A thing is moved"
msgstr "物品被移动"

msgid "A thing's state changes, such as lost or sold"
msgstr "物品状态发生变化，例如丢失或售出"

msgid "A token lets an app such as Claude Desktop, or a Shortcut on your phone, find and add your things. Make one for each app, limited to the locations it needs."
msgstr "令牌可让 Claude Desktop 或手机快捷指令等应用查找并添加你的物品。建议为每个应用单独创建一个，并限制其仅访问所需的空间。"

msgid "A token starts with one location. Add another only if the app needs both."
msgstr "令牌默认仅授权一个空间。仅当应用确实需要访问多个空间时再添加。"

