msgstr "具备 <0>{picks}</0> 修改权限的令牌可让应用在这些空间之间移动物品，因此某空间的人可能会看到来自另一空间的内容。除非确实需要，否则建议为每个空间单独创建令牌。"

msgid "Add <0>Get Contents of URL</0> with this address, and set its method to POST:"
msgstr "添加<0>获取 URL 内容</0>操作并填入此地址，将方法设为 POST："

msgid "Add one to tell a home server, Home Assistant or a script when a thing is added, moved or changed in this location."
msgstr "添加一个 Webhook，在该空间内添加、移动或修改物品时通知家庭服务器、Home Assistant 或脚本。"

msgid "Add webhook"
msgstr "添加 Webhook"

msgid "Add your car to Kept with an odometer reading first; its address appears here then."
msgstr "请先在 Kept 中添加你的车辆并记录一条里程表读数，之后其快捷地址会显示在此处。"

msgid "Added by <0>{0}</0>"
msgstr "由 <0>{0}</0> 添加"

msgid "Allow"
msgstr "允许"

msgid "Any MCP client"
msgstr "任意 MCP 客户端"

msgid "Anyone who can open the Shortcut on your phone can log readings in that location. If the phone is lost, revoke the token in Settings → Connections."
msgstr "任何能打开你手机上该快捷指令的人都可以在该空间中记录读数。如果手机丢失，请在“设置 → 连接”中撤销该令牌。"

msgid "Apps like claude.ai connect over OAuth only to an https address they can reach. Set <0>KEPT_PUBLIC_URL</0> to one. Until then, people connect apps with a personal token."
msgstr "像 claude.ai 这类应用只能通过 OAuth 连接到可公网访问的 https 地址。请将 <0>KEPT_PUBLIC_URL</0> 设为该地址。在此之前，成员可使用个人令牌连接应用。"

msgid "Apps using it stop working at once. Changes it made stay, and can still be undone for 7 days."
msgstr "使用该令牌的应用将立即失效。其已做出的更改会保留，并在 7 天内支持撤销。"

