msgstr "此登录方式仅适用于已绑定该方式的账号或受邀用户。Kept 不会因为邮箱相同而自动合并账号。"

msgid "Signing in with <0>{who}</0> didn't work"
msgstr "使用 <0>{who}</0> 登录失败"

msgid "Signing secret"
msgstr "签名密钥"

msgid "Start connecting again from the app."
msgstr "请从应用中重新开始连接。"

msgid "Tap the Shortcut at the pump or in the car park, type the odometer, and the reading is in Kept, with undo, as if you'd logged it here."
msgstr "在加油站或停车场轻点快捷指令并输入里程数，读数就会直接记入 Kept，效果与在应用内记录一致（同样支持撤销）。"

msgid "Tell your own server when things change here."
msgstr "当这里发生变动时通知你自己的服务器。"

msgid "Test sent: your server answered {code}"
msgstr "测试已发送：你的服务器返回状态码 {code}"

msgid "That address is on a private network, which this server doesn't allow."
msgstr "该地址位于私有网络中，此服务器不允许访问。"

msgid "That email address can't be used"
msgstr "无法使用该邮箱地址"

msgid "That's the name the app gives itself. Kept can't confirm who made it."
msgstr "这是应用自报的名称。Kept 无法核实其开发者身份。"

msgid "The app could move what it finds in one into another, so people in one could see what came from the other. Connect it to one location unless you mean that."
msgstr "该应用可能会将一个空间中查找到的内容移入另一个空间，使两个空间的成员互相看到彼此的数据。除非确有此意，否则请仅连接到一个空间。"

msgid "The app reads all of them together, and could repeat what it reads in one to someone who uses another. Connect it to one location unless you mean that."
msgstr "该应用会同时读取所有已连接空间的数据，并可能向其中一个空间的成员提及另一空间的内容。除非确有此意，否则请仅连接到一个空间。"

msgid "The current secret stops working at once. Deliveries fail to verify until your server has the new one."
msgstr "当前密钥将立即失效。在你的服务器更新为新密钥之前，推送校验将会失败。"

msgid "The email addresses don't match"
msgstr "两次输入的邮箱地址不一致"

msgid "The email on your <0>{who}</0> account isn't the one this invite or account is for."
msgstr "你的 <0>{who}</0> 账号关联的邮箱与此邀请或账号不匹配。"

msgid "The local model isn't installed on this server, so it can't be chosen."
msgstr "此服务器尚未安装本地模型，因此无法选择。"

msgid "The old secret stopped working. Put this one on your server; every delivery from now on is signed with it."
msgstr "旧密钥已失效。请将此新密钥配置到你的服务器上；此后每次推送都将使用它进行签名。"

msgid "The provider couldn't be reached when Kept started."
msgstr "Kept 启动时无法连接到该服务商。"

msgid "The provider says it's a different issuer from KEPT_OIDC_ISSUER."
msgstr "服务商返回的签发者 (Issuer) 与 KEPT_OIDC_ISSUER 不一致。"

msgid "The provider's address is on a private network, which this server doesn't allow."
msgstr "该服务商的地址位于内网，当前服务器不允许访问。"

msgid "The provider's discovery document didn't load."
msgstr "未能加载服务商的发现文档。"

msgid "The token lives in the Shortcut"
msgstr "令牌保存在快捷指令中"

msgid "There's no account for you here yet"
msgstr "你在这里还没有账号"

msgid "Things indexed for search"
msgstr "已建立搜索索引的物品"

