msgstr "此 Kept 实例仅限受邀加入。请让现有用户向你发送邀请，然后通过邀请链接加入。"

msgid "This request isn't valid any more"
msgstr "此请求已失效"

msgid "This server: a {size} download, once. Runs here; no key; no per-call cost."
msgstr "本地服务器：需一次性下载 {size} 模型文件。完全本地运行，无需密钥，无按次调用费用。"

msgid "Tokens and connected apps"
msgstr "令牌与已连接应用"

msgid "Tokens and connected apps let AI apps like Claude, and your own scripts, find and add your things. Each is limited to the locations you choose, and every change it makes is listed below with undo."
msgstr "借助令牌与已连接应用，Claude 等 AI 应用及你自己的脚本可以查找并添加物品。每项授权仅限于你选定的空间，且每次变更都会列在下方并支持撤销。"

msgid "Try again, or sign in another way. The reason it gave: <0>{code}</0>"
msgstr "请重试，或换一种方式登录。返回原因：<0>{code}</0>"

msgid "Trying again {next}"
msgstr "将于 {next} 重试"

msgid "Turn semantic search off?"
msgstr "关闭语义搜索？"

msgid "Turned off by an admin."
msgstr "已被管理员关闭。"

msgid "Under Headers, add these two:"
msgstr "在 Headers（请求头）下，添加以下两项："

msgid "Undo for 7 days"
msgstr "7 天内可撤销"

msgid "Use a local model for search?"
